Z||000000||Bluebottlejunky||08-23-2001||10:34 PM||||Well guys, im really on the last string with this car..I decided that I would paint the Plenum/Middle Plenum/valve covers/  Well all said and done..I put it back togeather fired it up..etc..when driving it didnt wanna have power or anything no power..just kinda sluggish...so I replaced the (Fuel Filter, Coil, Ignition Module, MAT sensor) With all that done it drives pretty good till about 3500-4000 or bacily when the shift light comes on, then it just bog's down no power AT ALL.  It also kinda dose that if in at a stop sign and let off cluth and mash the gas it will chug chug then go.   The car sits at a pefect Idle about 1000-900.  timing is set at 10* with a timing light  Voltage is at about 15 volts when driving so that is good.  The oil pressure sits at like 4X something when driving..nice and steady. I don't have  cat so it cant be pluged..anyone..please i would be very greatfull with your help!<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85'GT 4sp<BR>AIM: <B>KilleRedGT</B>||||reg||1
Z||000001||p4n1c||08-23-2001||11:01 PM||||Sounds like a vacuum leak.  Did you replace the gaskets after pulling off the plenum and covers?||||reg||1
