Z||000012||stsmithgt||08-24-2001||07:04 PM||||I haven't heard anyone ask about fuel pressure.  Could there be a restriction somewhere when putting it back together?  Maybe a fuel regulater problem?  Is there a gasket that could have been put on upside down that puts a hole in the wrong spot?  Could the fuel pump have taken a dump coinsidentally?  As you can tell, I'm shooting in the dark since I haven't had mine apart, but maybe somebody else will come up with an idea whats wrong from my questions.  Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>My work of art.(in progress.)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||5
